[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m## flutter_pty2 with coalesced reads — 2026-11-20[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mOld: `flutter_pty2` 1.0.0 from pub.dev, which the example depends on. New: a[m
