[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m### Where the time goes[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mSampled per thread during the run: the main thread sits at ~97% of one core,[m
