[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mWall, `write` and frames are the profiled view leg: frames is how many were[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mdrawn while that payload streamed. Frame build time is 0-2% of wall on every[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mrow.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m**The cost is in the core, not in layout or paint.** Taking `TerminalView`[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46maway moves no row by more than 6%. On the four slow payloads, decode plus the time inside[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m`terminal.write` is 96-98% of the main thread's wall time. Decode is not[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mmeasurable in the app — it runs in the stream transform before `write` — so[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mthat share is derived: decode seconds come from the headless probe's[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m`decode-1k` column (64 MiB at 1 KiB chunks), not from the app.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m**The PTY hands `terminal.write` about 1 KiB per call,** not the 64 KiB the[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mdriver writes (`XB_PROF` counts calls). The probe's `-1k` columns run the same[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mfiles at that size; it changes `full` by under 5% on every row, so the headless[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mtable stands for the app.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m**Parsing off the UI thread would fix the stutter, not the throughput.** The[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mslow payloads get one frame in a 4-10 s burst, and a parser isolate would give[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mthose frames back. But the stream is sequential: another core parses it at the[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46msame rate, and the payload drains no sooner. Throughput has to come out of the[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mcore, which is the next section.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m```sh[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mmkdir -p /tmp/pay[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mpython3 script/term_compare/gen.py 64 /tmp/pay[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mpython3 script/term_compare/gen_synthetic.py 32 /tmp/pay[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m# /tmp/ulp-base: the probe built at 8e2b14b, recipe in the next section[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m/tmp/ulp-base 5 /tmp/pay/{ascii,unicode,latin-ext,cyrillic,cjk,emoji,combining,box} > /tmp/probe.txt[m
