[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m### How it was accepted[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m`script/grapheme_grid_dump.dart` digests the grid a file leaves behind — code[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mpoint, width and combining string per cell, wrap flags, cursor — and[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m`script/term_compare/gen_corpus.py` writes a 335-file adversarial corpus:[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mevery class in isolation, targeted sequences (jamo, Prepend, ZWJ, regional[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mindicators, VS15/VS16, modifiers, virama), lines filled to the edge, nearly[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mevery code point after each of 27 bases, and slices of the payloads above. Old binary[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46magainst new, the digests were identical in four configurations (100x37 and[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m7x10, mode 2027 on and off), checked after every change. Deliberately broken[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mvariants changed 8-21 files' digests, so the oracle does catch errors. Each[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mpredicate also has an exhaustive test over U+0000-U+10FFFF against real[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46msegmentation, the plane-1 table one against the binary search it replaces.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mTests 1079 → 1094, all passing.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mWhat that does not cover: the digest leaves out cell attributes and the[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mpending-wrap state. The numbers are headless; the app was not re-measured.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mAnd the width table is Unicode 17 while `characters` 1.4.1 segments by[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mUnicode 16 — `zeroWidthExtends` works around the difference (U+1ACF-1AEB), and[m
