Author: klc <m_kilic@outlook.com.tr>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 00:10:50 2026 +0300

    fix(terminal): close escape-injection and remote-resize paths
    
    - Remote output can no longer resize the terminal (CSI 8;r;c t, CSI Ps t,
      DECSCPP, DECSNLS) unless Terminal(allowRemoteResize: true) is set;
      allowed sizes are clamped to 1..1000.
    - REP repeats at most one screenful.
    - CSI 21 t always reports an empty title instead of echoing it into the
      input stream.
    - DECAUPSS ignores malformed designators, so DECRQUPSS cannot echo
      control characters.
    - Malformed OSC 133 cmdline_url, XTGETTCAP and OSC colour values no
      longer throw from write() or produce negative colours.
    - Non-bracketed paste turns CRLF into one CR, not two.
    - RIS clears OSC colour overrides, DECAC assignments and saved DEC modes.
    - VPA no longer drifts the cursor, and CHA/HPA are relative to the left
      margin, in origin mode with left/right margins.
    - Search and URL detection skip the padding cell left where a wide
      character wrapped to the next row.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

