[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mprograms installed, and the only step that touches the machine it runs on.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m**`example/lib/screenshot.dart`** replays a recording into a `Terminal`, paints[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mone frame of a real `TerminalView` into a `RepaintBoundary`, and writes the[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mresult to `media/`. No PTY, no keystroke injection, no window chrome — the same[m
