[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mthe recorded program's, so the scene replays `shell` and then searches it.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m## Watch what you record[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m`record.py` captures whatever the program prints on **this** machine. The htop[m
