[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m* `CursorStyle.isItalic` replaces `isItalis`, which had carried the typo since[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m  it was introduced. The old name stays as a deprecated alias and will go in[m
