[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mthat started this investigation were debug-mode charts.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mThe harness lives in `example/lib/benchmark.dart`. It drives the terminal with a[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mprecomputed, fixed byte stream — one write per frame, no PTY, no shell — so two[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mruns on the same machine do the same work. The viewport is pinned to[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46m1000x600 logical pixels rather than filling the window, because cell count[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mdrives every cost in the paint path.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m[38;2;166;226;46mResults print to the console prefixed with `[xterm2-bench]`.[m
[38;2;166;226;46m+[m
