Author: klc <m_kilic@outlook.com.tr>
Date:   Mon Aug 3 23:28:18 2026 +0300

    refactor(terminal): extract color overrides into _ColorRegistry
    
    Move the OSC 4/5/10-19 color override state (indexed, special, and
    dynamic color overrides, plus the colorRevision counter) out of
    Terminal's field list into a new _ColorRegistry class, part of the
    terminal.dart library via terminal_modes.dart's part-file pattern.
    
    This is a pure field relocation, same approach as the _TerminalModes
    extraction: all mutation/query logic (setIndexedColor, resetSpecialColors,
    setDynamicColor, etc.) stays on Terminal as EscapeHandler overrides,
    now operating on _colors.<field> instead of a bare private field. No
    method signatures or behavior changed.
    
    _assignedColors/_alternateTextColors (DEC "assign color"/"alternate
    text color" attributes) are a distinct, unrelated mechanism and were
    deliberately left where they are.
    
    terminal.dart drops from 4453 to 4440 lines; terminal_colors.dart adds
    27.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

