    docs(benchmarks): record profile-mode flood measurement
    
    Decision input for the frame-coalescing and dirty-row proposals. On macOS
    in profile mode no workload exceeds the frame budget, and the worst UI
    frame during a 32 MiB flood is 4.2 ms against a 16.7 ms budget - so the
    "sustained output starves the UI" premise behind both proposals does not
    hold on desktop. Records the mobile caveat as the condition for revisiting.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

