    lookups (159us down to 93us per frame's worth of lookups in a JIT
    microbenchmark). Every color that reaches this point originates from the
    sRGB palette, from a theme color, or from `withValues`/`alphaBlend` on
    one of those, so the packed value identifies the color uniquely and the
    key space cannot collide.
    
